        <div class="longform">

          <h3 data-en="What is a 15-yard roll-off dumpster?" data-es="¿Qué es un contenedor roll-off de 15 yardas?">What is a 15-yard roll-off dumpster?</h3>
          <p data-html data-en="The 15-yard is bigger than a 10-yard but still residential-friendly. Its dimensions are roughly <strong>16 feet long, 8 feet wide, and 4 feet tall</strong>, with an open top and a back swing-door for walk-in loading. By volume, fifteen cubic yards holds about 7 full-size pickup truck loads of debris." data-es="El de 15 yardas es más grande que uno de 10 yardas pero aún ideal para uso residencial. Sus dimensiones son aproximadamente <strong>16 pies de largo, 8 pies de ancho y 4 pies de alto</strong>, con tapa abierta y una puerta trasera abatible para cargar caminando. Por volumen, quince yardas cúbicas caben unas 7 cargas completas de camioneta.">The 15-yard is bigger than a 10-yard but still residential-friendly. Its dimensions are roughly <strong>16 feet long, 8 feet wide, and 4 feet tall</strong>, with an open top and a back swing-door for walk-in loading. By volume, fifteen cubic yards holds about 7 full-size pickup truck loads of debris.</p>
          <p data-en="Most homeowners pick the 15 when they're between a 10 and a 20 — when the project is bigger than a single room but they don't need the full 20-yard footprint. It's also our most-requested size for jobs with heavier debris, because the extra capacity gives breathing room before the weight limit gets tight." data-es="La mayoría de los propietarios eligen el de 15 cuando están entre un 10 y un 20 — cuando el proyecto es más grande que una sola habitación pero no necesitan todo el espacio de un 20. También es nuestro tamaño más solicitado para trabajos con escombros más pesados, porque la capacidad extra da margen antes de que el límite de peso se ponga ajustado.">Most homeowners pick the 15 when they're between a 10 and a 20 — when the project is bigger than a single room but they don't need the full 20-yard footprint. It's also our most-requested size for jobs with heavier debris, because the extra capacity gives breathing room before the weight limit gets tight.</p>

          <h3 data-en="Common 15-yard projects in the DMV" data-es="Proyectos comunes de 15 yardas en el DMV">Common 15-yard projects in the DMV</h3>
          <p data-en="After hundreds of 15-yard drops across Prince George's County, Montgomery County, and northern DC, these are the projects we see again and again:" data-es="Después de cientos de entregas de 15 yardas en Prince George's County, Montgomery County y el norte de DC, estos son los proyectos que vemos una y otra vez:">After hundreds of 15-yard drops across Prince George's County, Montgomery County, and northern DC, these are the projects we see again and again:</p>
          <ul>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Kitchen remodels.</strong> Down-to-studs kitchen demo — cabinets, countertops, appliances, drywall, flooring. A 15 is the right size for a single kitchen; a galley kitchen might fit a 10, but anything bigger goes here." data-es="<strong>Remodelaciones de cocina.</strong> Demolición de cocina hasta los montantes — gabinetes, encimeras, electrodomésticos, paneles de yeso, pisos. Un 15 es el tamaño justo para una sola cocina; una cocina tipo pasillo podría caber en un 10, pero cualquier cosa más grande va aquí."><strong>Kitchen remodels.</strong> Down-to-studs kitchen demo — cabinets, countertops, appliances, drywall, flooring. A 15 is the right size for a single kitchen; a galley kitchen might fit a 10, but anything bigger goes here.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Roofing tear-offs (small to mid-size).</strong> Up to roughly 20 squares of asphalt shingles. Shingles fill weight before volume, which is why we recommend the 15 over the 10 for roof jobs even when the volume looks smaller." data-es="<strong>Remociones de techo (de pequeñas a medianas).</strong> Hasta cerca de 20 cuadros de tejas de asfalto. Las tejas llenan el peso antes que el volumen, por eso recomendamos el 15 sobre el 10 para trabajos de techo aun cuando el volumen parezca menor."><strong>Roofing tear-offs (small to mid-size).</strong> Up to roughly 20 squares of asphalt shingles. Shingles fill weight before volume, which is why we recommend the 15 over the 10 for roof jobs even when the volume looks smaller.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Two-bath gut renovations.</strong> Two full bathrooms — tile, tub, vanity, drywall, fixtures — fit comfortably with room for the related plumbing and framing demo." data-es="<strong>Renovaciones completas de dos baños.</strong> Dos baños completos — azulejo, tina, tocador, paneles de yeso, accesorios — caben cómodamente con espacio para la demolición de plomería y estructura relacionada."><strong>Two-bath gut renovations.</strong> Two full bathrooms — tile, tub, vanity, drywall, fixtures — fit comfortably with room for the related plumbing and framing demo.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Basement cleanouts and conversions.</strong> A heavily-stored basement plus old furniture, carpet, paneling, and built-ins. Basements accumulate volume faster than people expect." data-es="<strong>Limpiezas y conversiones de sótano.</strong> Un sótano lleno de cosas más muebles viejos, alfombra, paneles y empotrados. Los sótanos acumulan volumen más rápido de lo que la gente espera."><strong>Basement cleanouts and conversions.</strong> A heavily-stored basement plus old furniture, carpet, paneling, and built-ins. Basements accumulate volume faster than people expect.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Mid-size yard waste hauls.</strong> Multiple trees taken down, large brush clearing, big landscape overhauls. Yard waste is bulky and a 15-yard gives you elbow room." data-es="<strong>Acarreos medianos de desechos de jardín.</strong> Varios árboles talados, despeje grande de maleza, renovaciones grandes de paisajismo. Los desechos de jardín son voluminosos y un 15 yardas te da espacio de sobra."><strong>Mid-size yard waste hauls.</strong> Multiple trees taken down, large brush clearing, big landscape overhauls. Yard waste is bulky and a 15-yard gives you elbow room.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 data-en="How much weight can a 15-yard hold?" data-es="¿Cuánto peso aguanta un contenedor de 15 yardas?">How much weight can a 15-yard hold?</h3>
          <p data-html data-en="Every 15-yard rental includes delivery, pickup, and a 14-day rental. Pricing is quoted per project — priced to your material, so call or request a free quote — and heavy materials are quoted separately. That's why the 15 is often the smarter choice for heavier debris even when you don't need the extra volume." data-es="Cada renta de 15 yardas incluye entrega, recogida y renta de 14 días. El precio se cotiza por proyecto — según tu material, así que llama o solicita una cotización gratis — y los materiales pesados se cotizan por separado. Por eso el 15 suele ser la opción más inteligente para escombros más pesados aun cuando no necesites el volumen extra.">Every 15-yard rental includes delivery, pickup, and a 14-day rental. Pricing is quoted per project — priced to your material, so call or request a free quote — and heavy materials are quoted separately. That's why the 15 is often the smarter choice for heavier debris even when you don't need the extra volume.</p>
          <p data-en="Materials that hit the weight first: asphalt shingles, concrete, brick, dirt, plaster lath, and tile set on concrete board. Materials that hit the volume first: cabinets, framing, drywall, mattresses, furniture, yard waste. If your project is mixed, you're usually fine. If it's mostly heavy debris, ask us — we may suggest a heavy-debris quote on a different line." data-es="Materiales que llegan al peso primero: tejas de asfalto, concreto, ladrillo, tierra, listones de yeso y azulejo montado sobre tabla de cemento. Materiales que llegan al volumen primero: gabinetes, estructura, paneles de yeso, colchones, muebles, desechos de jardín. Si tu proyecto es mixto, normalmente estás bien. Si es mayormente escombro pesado, pregúntanos — podemos sugerir una cotización de escombro pesado en una línea diferente.">Materials that hit the weight first: asphalt shingles, concrete, brick, dirt, plaster lath, and tile set on concrete board. Materials that hit the volume first: cabinets, framing, drywall, mattresses, furniture, yard waste. If your project is mixed, you're usually fine. If it's mostly heavy debris, ask us — we may suggest a heavy-debris quote on a different line.</p>

          <h3 data-en="Where will the 15-yard fit on my property?" data-es="¿Dónde cabe el de 15 yardas en mi propiedad?">Where will the 15-yard fit on my property?</h3>
          <p data-en="The 15-yard is still a residential-driveway container — it just needs a bit more length than the 10. Placement options:" data-es="El de 15 yardas sigue siendo un contenedor para parqueo residencial — solo necesita un poco más de largo que el de 10. Opciones de colocación:">The 15-yard is still a residential-driveway container — it just needs a bit more length than the 10. Placement options:</p>
          <ul>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Driveway, parallel to the house.</strong> Most common. The 16-ft length usually fits in a standard residential driveway with a foot or two to spare." data-es="<strong>Parqueo, paralelo a la casa.</strong> Lo más común. El largo de 16 pies normalmente cabe en un parqueo residencial estándar con uno o dos pies de sobra."><strong>Driveway, parallel to the house.</strong> Most common. The 16-ft length usually fits in a standard residential driveway with a foot or two to spare.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Two-car driveway, side-by-side.</strong> Leaves room for one car in the second spot. Most clients prefer this configuration." data-es="<strong>Parqueo para dos autos, lado a lado.</strong> Deja espacio para un auto en el segundo lugar. La mayoría de los clientes prefieren esta configuración."><strong>Two-car driveway, side-by-side.</strong> Leaves room for one car in the second spot. Most clients prefer this configuration.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Side yard or back alley.</strong> Possible if the truck can swing in — mention it when you book." data-es="<strong>Patio lateral o callejón trasero.</strong> Posible si el camión puede entrar — menciónalo cuando reserves."><strong>Side yard or back alley.</strong> Possible if the truck can swing in — mention it when you book.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Public street (with permit).</strong> When your driveway can't fit a 15 or is being demoed, a temporary right-of-way permit handles it. We'll point you to the right office." data-es="<strong>Calle pública (con permiso).</strong> Cuando tu parqueo no puede acomodar un 15 o está en demolición, un permiso temporal de servidumbre de paso lo resuelve. Te indicamos la oficina correcta."><strong>Public street (with permit).</strong> When your driveway can't fit a 15 or is being demoed, a temporary right-of-way permit handles it. We'll point you to the right office.</li>
          </ul>
