          <div class="haul-card"><h4 data-en="Roofing materials" data-es="Materiales de techo">Roofing materials</h4><p data-en="Asphalt shingles, underlayment, flashing, plywood decking, nails. Up to ~20 squares is a comfortable fit." data-es="Tejas de asfalto, base, tapajuntas, cubierta de contrachapado, clavos. Hasta ~20 cuadros caben cómodamente.">Asphalt shingles, underlayment, flashing, plywood decking, nails. Up to ~20 squares is a comfortable fit.</p></div>
